        <mxCell id="bounds" value="RLS: transaction-local app.tenant_id; conversations also use app.user_id. Separate API / worker DB privileges. Text encryption uses AES-256-GCM with context binding. Vectors and blind-index patterns remain visible to the database. All advisors can see their tenant policies; per-policy ACLs are not implemented." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=15;spacing=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
